  "name": "Ledger Monitoring Prompts",
  "description": "This workflow enables users to manage and personalize ledger monitoring prompts. Create, edit, duplicate, enable, or disable prompts, search and filter by status, category, frequency, or priority, and quickly configure new prompts from a predefined catalog to proactively monitor financial exceptions, variances, and operational risks.",
